Bad spellcasters need HoB to cast low-level spells successfully.  I
guess on further reflection I can see why some people would use it, but
I doubt it's "too powerful" or would immediately displace other useful
items.

That is, IMO, one good criteria for new items: if they're likely to be
used by some people but not likely to be a clear "best choice" then
they'll add some variety to the endgame.  The downside is that it
basically duplicates the amulet's abilities, which is in general a bad
thing.  I'm not sure I have a strong opinion on whether I like the
proposal or not.



